# id: ironforge.place
# aliases: ironforge,great forge,forlorn cavern,military ward,hall of arms,ironforge weapon shop
# category: place
# priority: 80

Ironforge context: stone corridors, forge heat, ringing anvils, smoke, disciplined guards, clan gossip, old grudges, apprentices, travelers, bankers, craftsmen, weapon racks, and the feeling of a city carved into living mountain. Local NPCs often know each other by reputation because workplaces are close and news travels through shops, taverns, and training halls.
